# swagger.json is DELIBERATELY TRACKED (TASK-325) — do not re-ignore it.
#
# It is the OpenAPI contract Orval turns into the frontends' typed hooks, and
# ~116 source files import that generated output. While the spec was ignored, a
# clean checkout contained neither the spec nor the hooks, so the `typecheck` /
# `lint` / `build` / `test-unit` CI jobs — which run a bare `npm ci` — could not
# physically pass. They had been red since 2026-06-30.
#
# Regenerating it needs a booted AppModule and a live database, so it cannot be
# rebuilt from a bare checkout either. Committing it also makes the contract a
# reviewable artifact: an API change shows up as a spec diff in the PR.
#
# Regenerate with `npm run swagger:export -w apps/store-api` and commit the
# result. The `contract-freshness` CI job fails the build if you forget.

.env